HTML
----
    HeperText Markup Language
    Stucture and formating
    how things are formates in the web page 
    html is very simple language 
    we can formate or ugly formated paragraph to bulit points we can bold it 

HTML Elements
-------------
    Standard Elements that browser recognize

    ** Paragraph **
    <p>content</p>

    ** Heading **
    <h1> heading </h>


    these components used to design the structure of websites called HTML tags.

HTML tags
---------
    A container for some content or other tags.
    <p> This is a paragraph </p>
    <p></p> : Elements 
    this is a paragraph : content
    <p> : opening tags
    </p> closing tag

Heading Elements:
-----------------
    the <h1> to <h6> HTML elements represents six level of sections heading
    <h1> is the higest level and 
    <h6> is the lowest level

<html>
------
    html tag represent the root (top-level element) of a HTML document, so it is also referred to as the root element. All other elements must be descendendant of this element.

Document Metadata
------------------
    meta data contain the information about the page. it include information about style, script and data to help software use and render the page. Metadata for style and script may be defined in the page or linked to another file that has information.

<head>
------
    contains machine-readable information about the document like title, script, and stylesheet

<style>
-------
    contains style information for a document or a part of a document. it contain CSS, which applied to the content of the document containg the element.

<title>
-------
    Defines the document's title that is shown in a browser's title bar or a page;s tab. it only contain text 